        "text_gNHGeN": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Making India Water Positive!",
            "subheading": "OUR VISION",
            "text": "<p>Driven by a vision of a world where clean, soft water is accessible to all, Panthera was established in 2022 with a clear objective to develop innovative solutions that combat the effects of water hardness while promoting sustainability and environmental stewardship.</p><p>In an era where water quality is paramount, Panthera emerges as a pioneering force, dedicated to transforming the landscape of water treatment. With a focused mission to combat water scaling caused by hardness, Panthera stands at the forefront of innovation, offering unique solutions to soften water and enhance its quality.</p><p>At the heart of Panthera's ethos, lies an aim to improve the quality of life for its customers but also contributes to the preservation of our country’s precious resources. Our products are meticulously crafted to minimize environmental impact while maximizing performance, ensuring a harmonious balance between efficacy and eco-consciousness.</p><p>With a team of dedicated professionals, Panthera goes above and beyond to understand the unique needs of its clients, offering personalized solutions and unparalleled support every step of the way. Whether it's residential, commercial, or industrial applications, Panthera stands ready to deliver tailored solutions that exceed expectations.</p><p>In a world where water quality is non-negotiable, Panthera emerges as a beacon of innovation and integrity, driving positive change one drop at a time. With a steadfast focus on excellence, sustainability, and customer satisfaction, Panthera is not just a cleantech company but a catalyst for a brighter, cleaner future.</p>",
            "width": "50%",
            "alignment": "center",
            "align_text": "left",
            "text_size": "medium",
            "text_color": "inherit",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style": "m-button--primary",
            "button_size": "",
            "block_custom_class": "",
            "animations": "inherit"
          }
        },
