        "text_GQMryG": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Mr. Prasham Mehta",
            "subheading": "OUR FOUNDER",
            "text": "<h6>visionary leader and driving force behind Panthera, a pioneering company dedicated to revolutionizing water treatment and cleaning solutions. With a passion for innovation and a commitment to environmental sustainability, Prasham has built Panthera from the ground up, shaping it into a trusted name in the industry.</h6><h6>Prasham brings a wealth of expertise and experience to Panthera, with a Bachelors in Environmental Engineering & 1O year business experience in water treatment industry.</h6><h6>After graduating from LD College Of Engineering, Ahmedabad, back in 2014, he landed his first job with an MNC called Passavant Energy which had water treatment project running for end-user Ford Motors India at the manufacturing facility in Sanand, Gujarat. Post this, he served in different roles from Marketing to Proposals & Sales and worked his way to be promoted as a Business Development Director with Advent Envirocare Technology Pvt. Ltd.</h6><h6>From a rich experience in diverse fields such as engineering, project management,research and commercialization, and business development, it was finally the right time to start a venture which acknowledges the issue of water scaling caused by hardness and recognising the detrimental effects it has on individuals, communities and the environment.</h6>",
            "width": "50%",
            "alignment": "center",
            "align_text": "left",
            "text_size": "medium",
            "text_color": "inherit",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style": "m-button--primary",
            "button_size": "",
            "block_custom_class": "",
            "animations": "inherit"
          }
        }
