    "image_with_text_Gx7RDm": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "settings": {
        "heading": "",
        "heading_size": "h3",
        "subheading": "",
        "container": "container",
        "color_scheme": "scheme-cee058e4-58e3-46aa-9af9-219dadc79066",
        "item_gap": 40,
        "item_gap_mobile": 4,
        "layout": "left",
        "image_column_size": "6",
        "image_overlap": false,
        "show_image_reverse": false,
        "hover_effect": false,
        "image_animation": "none",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/Rectangle_17880.png",
        "link": "",
        "link_2": "",
        "second_image_offset_top": 10,
        "title": "Idea & Eureka Moments",
        "sub_title": "OUR STORY",
        "text": "<p>The Founder and his family had moved into their new house just a couple of years ago, and they started seeing all new taps, bathroom fixtures and showers being choked of water supply and white stain formations on new utensils! Gradually the water heaters and washing machines got affected, and they were observing hard water problems everywhere. In spite of installing a new salt-based traditional water softener and being in water industry, they were still helpless with the existing technologies. </p><p>One fine day during Covid lockdown, when no manpower was available, the softener suddenly stopped working and water woes worsened. After getting on numerous video calls and working with our plumber and technician, we managed to just start the operations. This was the moment, he felt something radical was needed to solve hard water problems with an effective, convenient and sustainable solution which does not waste salt or water.</p><p>After months of R&D on water softening agents, having tested different water quality samples across the city, we witnessed initial results with some experiments. On repeated trials, we saw an emerging consistency trend and decided to design a prototype. We developed a concept which can directly purify the water at source, without the need of complex installation or after services.  Finally, the ‘Eureka’ moment arrived and we could use our product for longer durations and decided to launch the MVP in the market to see the validation from customers! This is how, Scale-O was born.</p>",
        "text_size": "medium",
        "content_alignment": "left",
        "button_label": "",
        "button_link": "",
        "button_style": "m-button--link",
        "button_size": "",
        "padding_top": 100,
